      "id": 1,
      "userId": 1,
      "title": "Echoes of the Matterhorn",
      "body": "The crisp mountain air hits different here. Every view looks like it was meticulously painted. Today's hike up the Gornergrat offered unparalleled vistas of the iconic peak, bathed in the golden light of late afternoon.",
      "image": "https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1491555103944-7c647fd857e6?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1200&q=80",
      "location": "Switzerland",
      "date": "Oct 12, 2023",
      "tags": [
        "Hiking",
        "Nature"
      ],
      "images": [
        "https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1491555103944-7c647fd857e6?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1200&q=80"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "userId": 1,
      "title": "Neon Nights in Shinjuku",
      "body": "Navigating the labyrinthine alleys of Omoide Yokocho. The aroma of yakitori fills the air as locals and travelers alike crowd into tiny, intimate eateries. It's a sensory overload in the best possible way.",
      "image": "https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1542051841857-5f90071e7989?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1200&q=80",
      "location": "Japan",
      "date": "Sep 28, 2023",
